  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Short phrase / command",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 8,
  "source_text": "No, I'm not, really. It was just seeing the place again.",
  "target_text": "不, 我没事儿，真的没事儿 就是旧地重游",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 9,
  "source_text": "Shouldn`t love be the only truth?",
  "target_text": "爱不应该是这唯一的真相吗？",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Question",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 10,
  "source_text": "There's some things you just can't rush, buster.",
  "target_text": "有些東西是不能操之過急的，混蛋",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 11,
  "source_text": "If thrown off, one must remount immediately.",
  "target_text": "如果分开了 就马上骑上去",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Short phrase / command",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 12,
  "source_text": "It's ages since I've caught up on all the news.",
  "target_text": "我已经很久没有刷新八卦了",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 13,
  "source_text": "What should I do? Resume as soon as possible.",
  "target_text": "因为碰到了什么东西 所以发动机被停止了",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 14,
  "source_text": "This one's about scouts.",
  "target_text": "拿着，这是描写侦察兵的",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Short phrase / command",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 15,
  "source_text": "I said it! I said it! I said it!",
  "target_text": "是我说的",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Exclamation",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 16,
  "source_text": "That's what I mean by you make no sense.",
  "target_text": "所以说你胡说八道",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 17,
  "source_text": "Excuse me, please.",
  "target_text": "请原谅, 谢谢.",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Short phrase / command",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 18,
  "source_text": "Good night, sir.",
  "target_text": "晚安了 先生",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Short phrase / command",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 19,
  "source_text": "Goodbye, George!",
  "target_text": "再会，乔治！",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Exclamation",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 20,
  "source_text": "If you won't, you must do what I tell you.",
  "target_text": "如果你不走 你一定要按我说的做",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 21,
  "source_text": "Thanks. I'll get started now.",
  "target_text": "谢谢，那我开始了",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 22,
  "source_text": "When you come back, I shall be delighted.",
  "target_text": "当你回来时．我会很乐意接受",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 23,
  "source_text": "Let's think no more on these things.",
  "target_text": "我们不要再想这些事了",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Short phrase / command",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 24,
  "source_text": "THE BOSS WANTS TO SEE YOU.",
  "target_text": "- 我 干什么",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 25,
  "source_text": "She wanted to give him money no matter what,",
  "target_text": "白丝本想亲手把钱交给欣弥",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 26,
  "source_text": "For five years he pulls every trick in the book.",
  "target_text": "他这5年耍尽了手段",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 27,
  "source_text": "When will I see you again?",
  "target_text": "-我何时可以再见到你",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Question",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 28,
  "source_text": "Forget it, if you want to live.",
  "target_text": "忘了它 如果你还想活下去",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 29,
  "source_text": "All right, Pongo. All right, boy.",
  "target_text": "好了 庞戈 好吧 小伙计",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Short phrase / command",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 30,
  "source_text": "AND I THINK THEY CAN DO IT TOO.",
  "target_text": "他们都很出色",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 31,
  "source_text": "No, I didn't. Maybe he was with Kati, or Nena.",
  "target_text": "没有 也许他和卡蒂或尼娜在一起吧",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 32,
  "source_text": "I didn't try to kill the governor. I'm not a murderer!",
  "target_text": "我从未试过要杀掉总督 我不是凶手",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Exclamation",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 33,
  "source_text": "It isn't the part.",
  "target_text": "这与角色无关， 这是一个了不起的角色",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 34,
  "source_text": "Don't you see, Joe?",
  "target_text": "你不明白吗 乔？",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Question",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 35,
  "source_text": "I told you to keep away from her.",
  "target_text": "我告诉你离她远点!",
  "source": "OpenSubtitles v2024 (en-zh_CN), via ~/projects/OpenSubtitles (sample)",
  "category": "Statement",
  "human_checked": "no",
  "year": null
 },
 {
  "id": 36,
  "source_text": "\"Herald of Salvation\" of the Employee's Society.",
